window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-6e5b50840145f8df"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"image-generation\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">图像生成</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需完整的文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 后添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>你可以让 ChatGPT 生成或编辑图像。图像生成适合创建与代码配套的 UI 素材、横幅、背景、插图、精灵图集和占位图，也可以直接在 ChatGPT 聊天中使用。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：app</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>在应用的输入框中提出图像请求。如果你希望 ChatGPT 改造现有素材，或把它作为视觉参考，请添加一张参考图。</p> <p><a id=\"review-and-edit-generated-images\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_2\">查看和编辑生成的图像</h3> <p>选择一张生成的图像，打开其放大查看器。切换到 <strong>聚焦视图（Focused view）</strong> 可仔细查看一张图像；切换到 <strong>画布视图（Canvas view）</strong> 可查看同一聊天中生成的图像。</p> <p>在 <strong>画布视图（Canvas view）</strong> 中，使用 <strong>评论（Comment）</strong> 为一张或多张图像添加精确反馈。选择 <strong>多选（Multi-select）</strong>，选中要包含的图像，然后在同一聊天中发送评论和任何补充编辑指令。请说明哪些内容应改变，哪些内容应保持不变。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：web</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>在 ChatGPT 网页聊天中提出图像请求。如果你希望 ChatGPT 编辑参考图，或把它作为视觉参考，请将参考图附加到输入框。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：cli</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>在交互式会话中描述图像，或加入 <code>$imagegen</code> 以明确调用图像生成技能。如果现有图像需要用来指导结果，请用 <code>-i</code> 或 <code>--image</code> 附加该图像。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>在扩展聊天中提出图像请求。如果 Codex 应编辑现有素材或以其为基础继续创作，请按住 <kbd>Shift</kbd>，把参考图拖入输入框。</p> <p><a id=\"generate-or-edit-an-image\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">生成或编辑图像</h2> <p>用自然语言描述图像。如果你希望 ChatGPT 改造或扩展现有素材，请添加参考图。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：app,cli,ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>在提示词中加入 <code>$imagegen</code>，以明确调用图像生成技能。</p> <p>内置图像生成使用 <code>gpt-image-2</code>，并计入你的 Codex 常规用量限制。根据图像质量和尺寸，图像生成平均消耗套餐内额度的速度约为类似但不生成图像的对话轮次的 3–5 倍。若需更大批量，请在环境中设置 <code>OPENAI_API_KEY</code>，并要求 ChatGPT 通过 API 生成图像，以便按 API 定价计费。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：web</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>ChatGPT 网页版中的图像可用性和用量限制取决于你的方案和工作区设置。若要以编程方式生成图像，请使用<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">图像生成 API</a>。</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：app,web</strong></p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"write-effective-image-prompts\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">编写有效的图像提示词</h2> <p>实用的图像提示词往往只需一到三句清楚的话。请描述决定结果是否成功的细节：</p> <ul> <li>说明图像的用途或目标受众。</li> <li>指明主要主体以及正在发生的事情。</li> <li>描述场景、构图和视觉风格。</li> <li>如果取景、尺寸、光线、颜色或材质很重要，请一并说明。</li> <li>明确限制条件，包括图像绝对不能包含的内容。</li> </ul> <p>相比宽泛的感受，请优先使用具体的视觉语言。例如，与其要求“漂亮的光线”，不如说明光线从哪里照来。凡是必须保持不变的要求，都应重复强调。</p> <p><strong>示例提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Create a clean editorial illustration for an employee onboarding guide. Show a person organizing a project at a desk with a laptop, notebook, and simple progress checklist. Use soft daylight from a window on the left, restrained colors, and a modern, approachable style. Keep the background minimal. Do not include logos, text, or futuristic imagery.\n</code></pre> <blockquote> <p>中文意思：为员工入职指南创作一幅简洁的编辑插画：展示一位在桌前用笔记本电脑、笔记本和简易进度清单整理项目的人。柔和日光从左侧窗户照入，配色克制，风格现代且亲切。背景保持简洁；不要添加标志、文字或未来主义元素。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"refine-the-result\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">优化结果</h2> <p>先从核心想法开始，再进行小而明确的修改。每次只调整一个元素，避免构图和其他重要细节发生偏移。你也可以选中图像中的特定区域，并描述该区域需要怎样修改。</p> <p>编辑现有图像时，请准确说明哪些内容应改变、哪些内容必须保持不变。</p> <p><strong>示例提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Edit the attached image. Replace only the mug with a small potted plant. Preserve the person, desk layout, lighting, colors, crop, and every other detail exactly. Do not add text or logos.\n</code></pre> <blockquote> <p>中文意思：编辑所附图片。仅将杯子替换为一盆小型盆栽。人物、桌面布局、光线、颜色、裁切及其他所有细节都必须原样保留。不要添加文字或标志。</p> </blockquote> <p>若要进行范围更广的修改，请让反馈直接且可执行：调亮图像、降低色彩饱和度、简化背景，或保留构图但改变风格。</p> <p><a id=\"use-multiple-reference-images\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">使用多张参考图</h2> <p>如果一张图定义内容，另一张图定义风格、布局或其他视觉方向，可以使用少量参考图。请按顺序指出每张图，并说明它们之间的关系。组合元素时，使用前景、背景、左侧和右侧等空间词语。</p> <p><strong>示例提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Image 1 is the product photo to edit. Image 2 is the style reference. Keep the product, camera angle, layout, and objects from image 1, but apply the clean line work, muted palette, and soft shadows from image 2. Keep the product centered and leave the upper-right corner clear for later copy.\n</code></pre> <blockquote> <p>中文意思：图片 1 是要编辑的产品照片，图片 2 是风格参考。保留图片 1 中的产品、相机角度、布局和物体，但采用图片 2 的干净线条、低饱和配色和柔和阴影。让产品保持居中，并在右上角留白，供之后放入文案。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"add-text-to-an-image\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">在图像中添加文字</h2> <p>图中文字应简短，并准确指定。把确切文字放在引号中，保留你需要的大小写形式，并描述其字体风格、字号、颜色和位置。如果是不常见的名称且准确性很重要，请逐个拼出字母。还要说明是否允许出现其他文字。</p> <p><strong>示例提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Add only the title “SPRING WORKSHOP” in large, bold, white sans-serif letters, centered in the top third of the image. Keep the title on one line. Do not add any other text or change the underlying image.\n</code></pre> <blockquote> <p>中文意思：只在图像上方三分之一处居中添加标题“SPRING WORKSHOP”，字体为大号、粗体、白色无衬线字。标题保持单行；不要添加其他文字，也不要更改底图。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"create-infographics-and-dense-layouts\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_8\">创建信息图和密集布局</h2> <p>图像生成可以帮助你起草讲解图、海报、带标签的图表、时间线和其他信息密集型视觉内容。请描述信息层级和布局，保持标签简洁，并要求文字清晰呈现。对于密集文案或生产关键型排版，请逐字检查，并在需要时使用设计工具完成最终素材。</p> <p><a id=\"additional-considerations\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_9\">其他注意事项</h2> <ul> <li><strong>谨慎使用肖像。</strong> 描绘真人时，应在适当情况下提供参考照片，并确认你有权使用对方的肖像。</li> <li><strong>要求原创处理方式。</strong> 请求通用或原创的设计，不要模仿特定品牌、产品、艺术家或艺术作品。</li> <li><strong>署名并非必需。</strong> 生成的图像无需注明由 OpenAI 制作；不过，如果说明素材的制作方式对理解有帮助，你也可以提供相关背景。</li> <li><strong>遵守适用政策。</strong> 使用图像时，请遵循你所在组织的准则和 <a href=\"https://openai.com/policies/usage-policies/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI 使用政策（需联网）</a>。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"related-docs\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_10\">相关文档</h2> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：app</strong></p> </blockquote> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7?anchor=image-generation-usage-limits\">Codex 定价</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b64a9457088d1171\">图像输入</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">图像生成 API 指南</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1186da4cb8c2d6e2\">使用文件</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/image-generation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">使用 ChatGPT 创建图像（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation?gallery=open\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>图像生成画廊</strong><br>图片预览 探索更多图像生成提示词和结果。（本地尚未收录）</a></p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：web</strong></p> </blockquote> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b64a9457088d1171\">图像输入</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">图像生成 API 指南</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1186da4cb8c2d6e2\">使用文件</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/image-generation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">使用 ChatGPT 创建图像（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation?gallery=open\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>图像生成画廊</strong><br>图片预览 探索更多图像生成提示词和结果。（本地尚未收录）</a></p> <blockquote> <p><strong>适用界面：cli,ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7?anchor=image-generation-usage-limits\">Codex 定价</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b64a9457088d1171\">图像输入</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">图像生成 API 指南</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1186da4cb8c2d6e2\">使用文件</a></li> </ul> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation?gallery=open\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>图像生成画廊</strong><br>图片预览 探索更多图像生成提示词和结果。（本地尚未收录）</a></p>","en":"<h1 id=\"image-generation\">Image generation</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Ask ChatGPT to generate or edit images. Use image generation for UI assets, banners, backgrounds, illustrations, sprite sheets, and placeholders you want to create alongside code or in a ChatGPT chat.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: app</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>Ask for an image from the app composer. Add a reference image when you want ChatGPT to transform an existing asset or use it as visual guidance.</p> <h3 id=\"review-and-edit-generated-images\">Review and edit generated images</h3> <p>Select a generated image to open its expanded viewer. Switch between <strong>Focused view</strong> to inspect one image and <strong>Canvas view</strong> to see the images generated in the same chat.</p> <p>In <strong>Canvas view</strong>, use <strong>Comment</strong> to add precise feedback to one or more images. Select <strong>Multi-select</strong> to choose the images you want to include, then send your comments and any additional editing instructions in the same chat. Describe what should change and what should remain the same.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: web</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>Ask for an image in a ChatGPT web chat. Attach a reference image to the composer when you want ChatGPT to edit it or use it as visual guidance.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: cli</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>Describe the image in an interactive session or include <code>$imagegen</code> to invoke the image generation skill explicitly. Attach an existing image with <code>-i</code> or <code>--image</code> when it should guide the result.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>Ask for an image from the extension chat. Drag a reference image into the composer while holding <kbd>Shift</kbd> when Codex should edit or build on an existing asset.</p> <h2 id=\"generate-or-edit-an-image\">Generate or edit an image</h2> <p>Describe the image in natural language. Add a reference image when you want ChatGPT to transform or extend an existing asset.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: app,cli,ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>Include <code>$imagegen</code> in your prompt to invoke the image generation skill explicitly.</p> <p>Built-in image generation uses <code>gpt-image-2</code> and counts toward your general Codex usage limits. Image generations use included limits 3–5x faster on average than similar turns without image generation, depending on image quality and size. For larger batches, set <code>OPENAI_API_KEY</code> in your environment and ask ChatGPT to generate images through the API so API pricing applies.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: web</strong></p> </blockquote> <p>Image availability and usage limits in ChatGPT web depend on your plan and workspace settings. For programmatic image generation, use the <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Image generation API</a>.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: app,web</strong></p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"write-effective-image-prompts\">Write effective image prompts</h2> <p>A useful image prompt is often only one to three clear sentences. Describe the details that determine whether the result succeeds:</p> <ul> <li>Explain the image's purpose or intended audience.</li> <li>Name the main subject and what is happening.</li> <li>Describe the setting, composition, and visual style.</li> <li>Add framing, dimensions, lighting, colors, or materials when they matter.</li> <li>State constraints, including anything the image must not contain.</li> </ul> <p>Prefer concrete visual language over broad reactions. For example, describe where light comes from instead of asking for “beautiful lighting.” Repeat any requirement that must stay fixed.</p> <p><strong>Example prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Create a clean editorial illustration for an employee onboarding guide. Show a person organizing a project at a desk with a laptop, notebook, and simple progress checklist. Use soft daylight from a window on the left, restrained colors, and a modern, approachable style. Keep the background minimal. Do not include logos, text, or futuristic imagery.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"refine-the-result\">Refine the result</h2> <p>Start with the core idea, then make small, targeted revisions. Adjust one element at a time so the composition and other important details do not drift. You can also select a specific area of an image and describe the change for that area.</p> <p>When editing an existing image, say exactly what should change and what must stay the same.</p> <p><strong>Example prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Edit the attached image. Replace only the mug with a small potted plant. Preserve the person, desk layout, lighting, colors, crop, and every other detail exactly. Do not add text or logos.\n</code></pre> <p>For broader revisions, keep the feedback direct and actionable: make the image brighter, reduce the color saturation, simplify the background, or keep the composition while changing the style.</p> <h2 id=\"use-multiple-reference-images\">Use multiple reference images</h2> <p>Use a small set of reference images when one image defines the content and another defines the style, layout, or other visual direction. Identify each image by order and explain how the images relate. Use spatial terms such as foreground, background, left, and right when combining elements.</p> <p><strong>Example prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Image 1 is the product photo to edit. Image 2 is the style reference. Keep the product, camera angle, layout, and objects from image 1, but apply the clean line work, muted palette, and soft shadows from image 2. Keep the product centered and leave the upper-right corner clear for later copy.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"add-text-to-an-image\">Add text to an image</h2> <p>Keep in-image text short and specify it precisely. Put the exact text in quotation marks, preserve the capitalization you want, and describe its font style, size, color, and placement. For an uncommon name, spell out the letters when accuracy matters. State whether any other text is allowed.</p> <p><strong>Example prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Add only the title “SPRING WORKSHOP” in large, bold, white sans-serif letters, centered in the top third of the image. Keep the title on one line. Do not add any other text or change the underlying image.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"create-infographics-and-dense-layouts\">Create infographics and dense layouts</h2> <p>Image generation can help draft explainers, posters, labeled diagrams, timelines, and other information-rich visuals. Describe the information hierarchy and layout, keep labels concise, and request sharp text rendering. For dense copy or production-critical typography, review every word and finish the asset in a design tool when needed.</p> <h2 id=\"additional-considerations\">Additional considerations</h2> <ul> <li><strong>Use likenesses with care.</strong> When depicting a real person, provide a reference photo when appropriate and confirm that you have permission to use their likeness.</li> <li><strong>Ask for an original treatment.</strong> Request a generic or original design instead of imitating a specific brand, product, artist, or artwork.</li> <li><strong>Credit is optional.</strong> You do not need to credit OpenAI for generated images, though you can explain how an asset was made when that context is useful.</li> <li><strong>Follow applicable policies.</strong> Use images in accordance with your organization's guidelines and <a href=\"https://openai.com/policies/usage-policies/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI's usage policies (online)</a>.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"related-docs\">Related docs</h2> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: app</strong></p> </blockquote> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7?anchor=image-generation-usage-limits\">Codex pricing</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b64a9457088d1171\">Image inputs</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Image generation API guide</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1186da4cb8c2d6e2\">Work with files</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/image-generation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Creating images with ChatGPT (online)</a></li> </ul> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation?gallery=open\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Image generation gallery</strong><br>Image preview Explore more image generation prompts and results. (not in this local snapshot)</a></p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: web</strong></p> </blockquote> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b64a9457088d1171\">Image inputs</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Image generation API guide</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1186da4cb8c2d6e2\">Work with files</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/image-generation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Creating images with ChatGPT (online)</a></li> </ul> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation?gallery=open\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Image generation gallery</strong><br>Image preview Explore more image generation prompts and results. (not in this local snapshot)</a></p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Surface: cli,ide</strong></p> </blockquote> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7?anchor=image-generation-usage-limits\">Codex pricing</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b64a9457088d1171\">Image inputs</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Image generation API guide</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1186da4cb8c2d6e2\">Work with files</a></li> </ul> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation?gallery=open\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Image generation gallery</strong><br>Image preview Explore more image generation prompts and results. (not in this local snapshot)</a></p>"};
